  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Instead of dynamically calculating the number child resources of a federated resource, a container attribute should be maintained.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "From: ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "https://wiki.duraspace.org/display/FF/2016-02-11+-+Fedora+Tech+Meeting"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "https://wiki.duraspace.org/display/FF/2016-02-11+-+Fedora+Tech+Meeting",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "====",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "There is a child count property we could use - it does not indicate whether those children are in repository or federated storage",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Could we use a listener to listen for federated changes and update the property in Modeshape?",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Record number of children, bytes, and a timestamp and us a TTL to update at periodic intervals",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Not sure if we could override the way the federated filesystem gets queried for its contents",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "We could pursue one solution for in-repository content and another solution for federated resources",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Both solutions should use and maintain the same property",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "====",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
   "type": "doc",
   "version": 1
  },
